sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Student
    participant B as Backend (Go Gin)
    participant L as LockManager (pg_advisory_lock)
    participant DB as Postgres (student_{id} schema)

    S->>B: Submit SQL (Insert/Update/Delete)
    B->>L: ExecuteLocked(student_id)
    L->>DB: SELECT pg_advisory_lock(fnv(student_id))
    Note over B,L: Per-student serialisation across processes

    rect rgb(235, 240, 250)
        Note right of B: Phase 0: Sandbox preparation
        B->>DB: InitializeSandbox (idempotent)
        Note right of B: Only missing tables are cloned<br/>(LIKE INCLUDING ALL + INSERT SELECT)
        B->>DB: ResetTable(target) -- drop & re-clone target only
    end

    rect rgb(240, 240, 240)
        Note right of B: Phase 1: Establish Ground Truth
        B->>DB: Backup target table
        B->>DB: Execute Lecturer's Correct SQL
        DB-->>B: Return Modified State
        B->>B: Capture Diff (Corrected Result)
        B->>DB: Restore target from Backup
    end

    rect rgb(220, 240, 220)
        Note right of B: Phase 2: Validate Student Submission
        B->>DB: Execute Student SQL (SET ROLE exam_student)
        DB-->>B: Return Modified State
        B->>B: Capture Student Diff
        B->>B: Compare Diffs (Row-by-Row)
    end

    L->>DB: SELECT pg_advisory_unlock(fnv(student_id))

    alt Correct
        B-->>S: Return Full Score
    else Incorrect / Idempotent
        B-->>S: Return Partial/Zero Score
    end
